{"id":"0e2180c9b1ab4a9f8c000011","project":"QGIS","component":"qgis-application","context":"EliminateSelection","unit":"o:qgis:p:QGIS:r:qgis-application:s:136eafbd955f997185a3edbac3e6bfcc","source":["This algorithm combines selected polygons from the input layer with certain adjacent polygons by erasing their common boundary. The adjacent polygon can be either the one with the largest or smallest area or the one sharing the largest common boundary with the polygon to be eliminated.\nEliminate is normally used to get rid of sliver polygons, i.e. tiny polygons that are a result of polygon intersection processes where boundaries of the inputs are similar but not identical."],"target":["Den här algoritmen kombinerar valda polygoner från indatalagret med vissa angränsande polygoner genom att ta bort deras gemensamma gräns. Den angränsande polygonen kan vara den med störst eller minst area, eller den som delar den längsta gemensamma gränsen med polygonen som ska elimineras.\nEliminera används vanligen för att ta bort sliverpolygoner, det vill säga små polygoner som uppstår vid polygonkorsningar där indatagränserna är likartade men inte identiska."],"note":"Bevarar den obligatoriska radbrytningen och rättar felstavning samt oidiomatisk svenska.","publication_status":"local-reviewed-pending-upload","evidence":{"artifact":"https://app.transifex.com/qgis/qgis/translate/#sv/qgis-application/","sha256":"d6386636fa33d40ee03aa4049a6bc9b44fb65e9ef7e52a315c8b6f2d07b4ddfc"},"source_evidence":{"artifact":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qgis/QGIS/master/i18n/qgis_sv.ts","sha256":"d6386636fa33d40ee03aa4049a6bc9b44fb65e9ef7e52a315c8b6f2d07b4ddfc"}}
